- deepdefence.c:2338 deep_kill_sorties() -- item 1. Selection is
  best-duel-chance; no target value anywhere.
- deepdefence.c:4002 deep_military_choose_build() -- items 2 and 5.
  Defender want set at :4182 (first defender) and :4269 (defender).
- deephorizon.c:1444 deep_adjust_building_wants() -- items 3, 4, 6.
  Credit functions add to building_want[]; most gated on !threatened,
  culture credit is the precedent for a threat-exempt credit.

Facts verified in the tree (not assumed):
- is_stack_vulnerable() (common/combat.c:996) is FALSE inside a city, so
  the killstack prize applies to the ADJACENT open tiles a sortie hits
  and not to the garrison itself. Gated on game.info.killstack and
  !EF_NO_STACK_DEATH.
- civ2civ3 carries Unit_No_Lose_Pop on City Walls (effects.ruleset:1902)
  and Great Wall (:3123), plus a MinSize<2 rule (:3987). So item 3 has
  population in the benchmark ruleset.
- killcitizen + UCF_KILLCITIZEN at server/unithand.c:4601 is the
  mechanic; CONSEQ already verified capture costs exactly 1 size point.

